{
  "job_B8.1.4.2_20251003_114807": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00fein folc & on \u00feine hus ealle fleogena cynn, & & ic wyrce \u00f0onne on d\u00e6g micele wundra on Gessen lande, \u00fe\u00e6r min folc is, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0ar ne beo\u00f0 nane & ic sette dal betwyx \u00fein folc & min folc; to merigen bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t tacn. & Drihten dyde swa, & \u00f0\u00e6t m\u00e6ste fleogena cyn comon on Faraones hofon & on eall Egypta land, & Pharao cleopode Moyses & Aaron, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him: Ga\u00fe & offria\u00f0 eowrum Gode on \u00feison lande. & Moyses cw\u00e6\u00f0: Hit ne m\u00e6g swa beon; sceolon we ofrian urum Drihtne \u00fea \u00feing \u00f0e Egypta \u00d0reora daga f\u00e6reld we sceolon faran on \u00fe\u00e6t westen & ofrian urum Drihtne, swa he us bebead. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Farao: Ic eow forl\u00e6te \u00fe\u00e6t ge ofrian Drihtne, eowrum Gode on westene; & \u00feeahhw\u00e6\u00f0ere ne & Moyses cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fea he ut eode: For \u00f0e ic gebidde, & \u00feeos fleoge f\u00e6r\u00f0 fram \u00f0e & fram \u00f0inum folce \u00d0a Moyses ut eode fram Faraone, he hine geb\u00e6d to Drihtne. & Drihten dide swa he hine b\u00e6d, & adraf \u00f0a fleogan fram Faraone & fram hys folce, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6r ne \u00dea wear\u00f0 Faraones heorte gehefegod, swa \u00fe\u00e6t he witodlice \u00e6t \u00f0am cyrre nolde \u00fe\u00e6t folc forl\u00e6tan. SO\u00feLICE Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Moyse: Ga in to Pharaone, & cwe\u00f0 to him: Drihten, Ebrea God, seg\u00f0 \u00feas Gyf \u00f0u \u00f0\u00e6t onscunast & \u00fe\u00e6t",
